OL,3,AMet Police boss 'wouldn't be surprised'
OL,4,Aif more allegations made about Brand
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe head of the Metropolitan Police
OL,7,Fsaid he "wouldn't be surprised" if more
OL,8,Fpeople came forward to make allegations
OL,9,Fabout entertainer and comedian Russell
OL,10,FBrand.
OL,12,FOn Thursday, Brand was found guilty of
OL,13,Fone count of rape and three counts of
OL,14,Fsexual assault.
OL,16,FMet Police boss Sir Mark Rowley also
OL,17,Ftold BBC Radio 4's Today programme on
OL,18,FFriday that what he heard reported from
OL,19,FBrand's trial at Southwark Crown Court
OL,20,Fcame very close to "victim blaming".
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
