OL,3,AManhunt after boy's sword injury
OL,4,Asparked lockdowns
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has been arrested on suspicion
OL,7,Fof assisting an offender and remains in
OL,8,Fcustody, but officers are still hunting
OL,9,Ffor the two men who were reportedly
OL,10,Fchasing two boys.
OL,12,FOfficers remain outside both schools,
OL,13,Fbut all pupils have now been sent home.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
