OL,3,AFour midterms takeaways for 2028 White
OL,4,AHouse race
OL,5,
OL,6,FBallots are still being counted in the
OL,7,FUS midterm elections but the political
OL,8,Flandscape is already pivoting to the
OL,9,F2028 White House race.
OL,11,FBuoyed by major gains in Congress,
OL,12,FDemocrats will have momentum as they
OL,13,Fprepare for the contest to succeed
OL,14,FPresident Donald Trump.
OL,16,FBut a good showing in the midterms does
OL,17,Fnot guarantee a White House win two
OL,18,Fyears later. Barack Obama was
OL,19,Fre-elected in 2012 despite huge
OL,20,FRepublican gains in 2010.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
